                  <div class="pathways-container">
                     
                     <div class="content-block-video">
                        
                        <div class="content-block-video-text">
                           
                           <h2>What Makes an Archer?</h2>
                           
                           <p>At St. Louis Community College, Archers excel with heart and determination in everything
                              they pursue. Student-athletes master the balance of academics and sports, growing
                              both on and off the field. Together, they create a supportive community, celebrating
                              wins and learning from challenges as a team.</p>
                           
                           <p>Whether in the classroom or on the field, STLCC student-athletes give their best effort
                              every day. Wearing the College’s colors with pride, they inspire others through their
                              energy and teamwork. The experiences gained as an Archer—from lifting up teammates
                              to overcoming obstacles—build lasting skills and unforgettable memories.</p>
                           
                           <p><a id="blue-button-snippet" class="blue-button-snippet-inverse" href="/locations/meramec/athletics-renovations.aspx">Learn About the Athletics Renovations</a></p>
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="content-block-video-iframe"><iframe class="pathways-video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vTEL-bKQGSE?si=SRSdj0DXDXPhKmBw" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               
               <div class="pathways-container">
                  
                  <h2>Archer Strong</h2>
                  
                  <p>No matter the sport or campus, our districtwide teams consistently deliver their best.
                     As proud members of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) and the
                     Midwest Community College Athletic Conference (MCCAC), STLCC offers eight competitive
                     sports programs.</p>
                  
                  <p>Want to catch a game or learn about tryouts? Click which sport you're interested in
                     for schedules, scores and the latest Archer news.</p>
                  
                  <div class="content-cards-3" style="justify-content: space-evenly;"><a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/bsb/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-baseball.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-baseball-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-baseball-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-baseball-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-baseball.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Baseball" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-baseball.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Baseball</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Meramec</h4>
                           
                           <p>Experience the intensity as the baseball team executes strategic plays and powerful
                              hits on the diamond.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/mbkb/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-mens-basketball.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-mens-basketball-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-mens-basketball-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-mens-basketball-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-mens-basketball.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Men's Basketball" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-mens-basketball.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Men's Basketball</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Forest Park</h4>
                           
                           <p>Watch the men's basketball team build momentum through strategic offense and team
                              collaboration.<br>&nbsp;</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/wbkb/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-basketball.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-basketball-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-basketball-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-basketball-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-basketball.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Women's Basketball" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-basketball.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Women's Basketball</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Forest Park</h4>
                           
                           <p>Feel the energy as the women's basketball team demonstrates their athletic talent
                              quarter after quarter.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/esports/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/news/2024/esports-article.jpg, /images/news/2024/esports-article-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/news/2024/esports-article-2x.jpg, /images/news/2024/esports-article-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/news/2024/esports-article.jpg" width="600" height="400" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #777;" alt="STLCC Esports" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-esports.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Esports</h3>
                           
                           <h4>South County</h4>
                           
                           <p>Dive into the action as the esports team competes using strategy and quick thinking
                              to outsmart their opponents.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/msoc/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-soccer.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-soccer-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-soccer-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-soccer-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-soccer.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Men's Soccer" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-soccer.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Men's Soccer</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Florissant Valley</h4>
                           
                           <p>See skilled footwork unfold as the men's soccer team takes the field to showcase talent
                              and teamwork.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/wsoc/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-womens-soccer.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-womens-soccer-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-womens-soccer-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-womens-soccer-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-womens-soccer.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Women's Soccer" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-womens-soccer.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Women's Soccer</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Meramec</h4>
                           
                           <p>Follow the women’s soccer team as they execute precise tactics and work together to
                              win on the field.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/sball/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-softball.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-softball-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-softball-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-softball-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-softball.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Softball" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-softball.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Softball</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Meramec</h4>
                           
                           <p>Cheer on the softball team as they combine powerful pitching with outstanding defense
                              at every position.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a> <a class="content-cards-3-cta content-cards-3-w" href="https://archersathletics.com/sports/wvball/index"> <picture>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-volleyball.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-volleyball-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                           <source srcset="/images/athletics/athletics-volleyball-2x.jpg, /images/athletics/athletics-volleyball-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/athletics/athletics-volleyball.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="STLCC Volleyball" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/athletics/athletics-volleyball.jpg'"></picture>
                        
                        <div>
                           
                           <h3>Volleyball</h3>
                           
                           <h4>Meramec</h4>
                           
                           <p>Experience the fast-paced action as the volleybal team commands each rally from serve
                              to point.</p>
                           </div>
                        </a></div>
                  
                  <p>&nbsp;</p>
                  
                  <div class="announcement-cta">
                     
                     <h2>Join the Team</h2>
                     
                     <p>Ready to elevate your game and become an Archer? STLCC Athletics offers an outstanding
                        opportunity to compete at the collegiate level while pursuing your academic goals.
                        Our coaches are committed to developing both your athletic talent and leadership potential.
                        Student-athletes can take their classes at any campus, offering flexibility to balance
                        academics and sports.</p>
                     
                     <p>Take the first step toward joining a team—connect with us today!</p>
                     
                     <p><a id="blue-button-snippet" class="blue-button-snippet-inverse" href="https://archersathletics.com/recruits/Recruit_Page">Connect With Athletics</a></p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
